Update the filter UI to perform asynchronous updates instead of full page reloads. For example, wrap the product list in a container that can be refreshed via AJAX:

```html
<div id="product-list" data-ajax="true">
  <!-- product items here -->
</div>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.filter-checkbox').forEach(cb => {
    cb.addEventListener('change', () => {
      fetch('/apply-filters', {method:'POST', body:new FormData()})
        .then(r=>r.text())
        .then(html=>{document.getElementById('product-list').innerHTML=html;});
    });
  });
</script>
```
